Adapted material and destinations:
- utils/client/ClientThemesUtils.kt: the 284 named RGB endpoint pairs in its
  cached themeColorMap -> render/airvisuals/AirPalette.java. Immutable Java enum;
  no repeated map construction, Kotlin runtime or LiquidBounce settings.
- ClientThemesUtils.kt / features/module/modules/client/ThemeManager.kt:
  palette selection and two-color theme behavior -> render/airvisuals/AirTheme.java.
  Timing rewritten as monotonic, interruptible cross-fades and delta-time motion.
- ui/client/hud/element/elements/NewArrayList.kt (source comment: "skid Opai"):
  sorted animated rows, rounded backgrounds, theme/rainbow accents and side stripes
  -> render/AirHudRenderer.java. Rewritten for Phantom modules, HUD values and fonts;
  roster/suffix sampling at 10Hz; persistent animation state; no AirClient module APIs.
- ui/client/hud/element/elements/Watermark.kt (credits FDPClient): rounded brand
  card with name/ping/time information -> render/AirHudRenderer.java. PHANTOM
  branding retained; null checks added; metrics cached; FPS and optional XYZ/BPS.
- utils/render/RoundedUtil.kt (credits FDPClient): precomputed arcs and rounded
  gradient drawing approach -> render/airvisuals/AirDraw.java. Bounded shadow rings,
  input validation, scoped GL state and no framebuffer/shader allocation.

Integration changes in PhantomHUD.java and SwordGlow.java route existing Phantom
settings, configuration and in-game theme colors to those helpers. They do not
import AirClient's module, setting, event, configuration or gameplay frameworks.

Excluded by user request: all ClickGUI variants, widgets and the HUD editor.
Also excluded: combat/movement/player modules, target HUD combat dependencies,
network commands/cloud configurations, accounts, music, logos, fonts and images.
No new font assets or shader assets were copied. Live HUD blur and framebuffer
bloom/shadows were omitted; rounded translucent cards and bounded shadow rings
provide the adapted presentation without importing those risky render pipelines.

